// Detection reports from the drones (edge-eye on the Jetson) to the ZBook.
//
// Keys:
//   sar/{incident}/uav/{uav}/detection      Jetson -> ZBook, reliable, high priority
//   sar/{incident}/uav/{uav}/ack            ZBook -> Jetson, detection ids received
//   sar/{incident}/sim/uav/{uav}/truth      simulation only: ground truth per frame, for scoring
//
// A Detection is sent when a tracked body part is confirmed (reason NEW) and
// again only when it changes materially (reason UPDATE). Every packet stays in
// the drone's on-disk queue until the ZBook acknowledges its detection_id, so
